<title>USA: IDEC Pharmaceuticals sets rights plan.</title>
<headline>IDEC Pharmaceuticals sets rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>IDEC Pharmaceuticals Corp Thursday approved a preferred share purchase rights plan with a 15 percent trigger.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said its rights plan is intended to guard against abusive takeover tactics and was not adopted in response to any specific overtures towards IDEC.</p>
<p>Under the plan, shareholders will receive one right to purchase one one-thousandth of a share of new preferred stock for each outstanding share of IDEC common stock owned.</p>
<p>The rights are exercisable if a person or group acquires, or attempts to acquire, 15 percent or more of IDEC common.</p>
</text>
